Let me start with a GraphQL query. First, list the projects and cycles. Linear's GraphQL API:

```graphql
query {
  projects(filter: { name: { eq: "Atlas" } }) {
    nodes {
      id
      name
      cycles {
        nodes {
          id
          name
          number
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Hmm, I'm not 100% sure about the shape of the filter input. Let me try a simple query that fetches all projects and filter client-side. That's safer.

